#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/atomic.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Nuclear Power Cell"
msgstr "Batteria nucleare"

#. type: Image filename
#: ../E/atomic.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "atomic"
msgstr "atomic"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/atomic.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A nuclear power cell supplies the bots and some buildings with energy.\n"
"Its capacity is 100 times that of a <a object|power>regular power cell</a>."
msgstr ""
"Una batteria nucleare fornisce energia ai robot e ad alcuni edifici.\n"
"La sua capacità è 100 volte quella di una <a object|power>batteria normale</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/atomic.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Nuclear power cells cannot be recharged or recycled. A <a "
"object|nuclear>nuclear plant</a> and some <a object|uranore>uranium ore</a> "
"is needed to produce a new and fully charged nuclear power cell."
msgstr ""
"Le batterie nucleari non si possono ricaricare né riciclare. Per produrne "
"una nuova e completamente carica servono una <a object|nuclear>centrale "
"nucleare</a> e del <a object|uranore>minerale di uranio</a>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/atomic.txt:8 ../E/bbox.txt:7 ../E/bullet.txt:5 ../E/enerspot.txt:10
#: ../E/flag.txt:11 ../E/key.txt:10 ../E/mine.txt:7 ../E/power.txt:9
#: ../E/stonspot.txt:7 ../E/target2.txt:5 ../E/titan.txt:7 ../E/titanore.txt:7
