#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/atomic.txt:9 ../E/bbox.txt:8 ../E/bullet.txt:6 ../E/key.txt:11
#: ../E/power.txt:10 ../E/titan.txt:8 ../E/titanore.txt:8 ../E/tnt.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All <a object|botgr>grabbers</a> and the <a object|human>astronaut</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tutti i <a object|botgr>robot trasportatori</a> e l’<a "
"object|human>astronauta</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/atomic.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>NuclearCell</code>"
msgstr "<code>NuclearCell</code>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/barrier.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Barrier"
msgstr "Barriera"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/barrier.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "The barrier is nothing more than an obstacle used in the exercises."
msgstr "La barriera è semplicemente un ostacolo utilizzato negli esercizi."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/barrier.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>Barrier</code>"
msgstr "<code>Barrier</code>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/base.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "<button 171/> Spaceship"
msgstr "<button 171/> Astronave"

#. type: Image filename
#: ../E/base.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "base"
msgstr "base"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/base.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<a object|human>Your</a> means of transportation from one planet to the "
"next, the only way to travel safely across the cosmos and accomplish your "
"missions."
msgstr ""
"Il <a object|human>tuo</a> mezzo di trasporto tra i pianeti, l’unico modo "
"per viaggiare in sicurezza nel cosmo e completare le missioni."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/base.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In addition to yourself, the spaceship can carry bots and raw materials. "
"Whenever a mission is completed, you must select the spaceship, then click "
"on the <takeoff> command <button 28/>."
msgstr ""
"Oltre a te, l’astronave può trasportare robot e materie prime. Dopo aver "
"completato una missione, seleziona l’astronave e premi il pulsante di "
"<decollo> <button 28/>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/base.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>SpaceShip</code>"
msgstr "<code>SpaceShip</code>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/bbox.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Black Box"
msgstr "Scatola nera"

#. type: Image filename
#: ../E/bbox.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "bbox"
msgstr "bbox"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/bbox.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A black box is actually orange so as to be easier to identify and locate. "
"Each <a object|base>spaceship</a> is equipped with a black box that records "
"and stores information about the flight."
msgstr ""
"In realtà una scatola nera è arancione, per essere individuata più "
"facilmente. Ogni <a object|base>astronave</a> ne possiede una, che registra "
"e conserva le informazioni sul volo."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/bbox.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A black box can also be used to leave important information. On every planet"
" the first expedition has left a black box containing the coordinates of the"
" planet it was heading towards next."
msgstr ""
"Una scatola nera può anche custodire informazioni importanti. Su ogni "
"pianeta la prima spedizione ne ha lasciata una con le coordinate della "
"destinazione successiva."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/bbox.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>BlackBox</code>"
msgstr "<code>BlackBox</code>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/bullet.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organic Matter"
msgstr "Materia organica"

#. type: Image filename
#: ../E/bullet.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "bullet"
msgstr "bullet"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/bullet.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The organic matter is the insects' secretion. <a object|wasp>Wasps</a> often"
" use balls of organic matter to bombard you. You should perhaps try to get "
"hold of some since it could allow you, given the necessary <a "
"object|labo>analysis</a>, to discover new and strange technologies that will"
" improve the efficiency of your bots."
msgstr ""
"La materia organica è una secrezione degli insetti. Le <a "
"object|wasp>vespe</a> usano spesso sfere di questa sostanza per bombardarti."
" Cerca di procurartene: con le opportune <a object|labo>analisi</a> potresti"
" scoprire nuove e insolite tecnologie capaci di migliorare l’efficienza dei "
"robot."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/bullet.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>OrgaMatter</code>"
msgstr "<code>OrgaMatter</code>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/captor.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "<button 174/> Power Captor"
msgstr "<button 174/> Parafulmine"

#. type: Image filename
#: ../E/captor.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "captor"
msgstr "captor"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/captor.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The power captor acts as both a lightning conductor and a power converter.\n"
"It offers protection within a radius of 50 meters against the perilous lightning bolts of magnetic storms. Additionally, when the captor is hit by lightning, all bots and <a object|power>power cells</a> placed underneath, with the exception of the <a object|atomic>nuclear power cells</a>, are recharged."
msgstr ""
"Il parafulmine funziona sia da protezione contro i fulmini sia da convertitore di energia.\n"
"Protegge entro un raggio di 50 metri dai pericolosi fulmini delle tempeste magnetiche. Quando viene colpito, ricarica tutti i robot e le <a object|power>batterie</a> posti sotto di esso, tranne le <a object|atomic>batterie nucleari</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/captor.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To visualize the zone shielded by a power captor, select it then hit the "
"<range> button <button 41/>. Red dots outline the circular zone for 20 "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"Per visualizzare l’area protetta, seleziona il parafulmine e premi il "
"pulsante <raggio> <button 41/>. Punti rossi delimitano la zona circolare per"
" 20 secondi."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/captor.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the vastness of space, few planets suffer from magnetic storms. Among the"
" ones you'll be visiting, only Orpheon is subject to this phenomenon."
msgstr ""
"Nell’immensità dello spazio, pochi pianeti subiscono tempeste magnetiche. "
"Tra quelli che visiterai, soltanto Orpheon è soggetto a questo fenomeno."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/captor.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that your <a object|base>spaceship</a> can also act as a lightning "
"conductor. However it will not recharge power cells."
msgstr ""
"Anche la tua <a object|base>astronave</a> può fungere da parafulmine, ma non"
" ricarica le batterie."

