#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/derrick.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "<button 161/> Derrick"
msgstr "<button 161/> Torre di estrazione"

#. type: Image filename
#: ../E/derrick.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "derrick"
msgstr "derrick"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/derrick.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "The derrick is intended for the extraction of raw materials."
msgstr "La torre di estrazione serve a estrarre materie prime."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/derrick.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In order to determine the best site on which to erect a derrick, a <a "
"object|botsr>sniffer</a> should be used to prospect the subsoil. The marks "
"it lays down provide information about the specifics of what the derrick "
"will be able to extract:"
msgstr ""
"Per scegliere dove costruire una torre di estrazione, usa un <a "
"object|botsr>robot rilevatore</a> per esaminare il sottosuolo. I suoi "
"segnali indicano il materiale estraibile:"

#. type: Bullet: '-'
#: ../E/derrick.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"a <a object|stonspot>red cross</a> -> <a object|titanore>titanium ore</a>."
msgstr ""
"una <a object|stonspot>croce rossa</a> -> <a object|titanore>minerale di "
"titanio</a>."

#. type: Bullet: '-'
#: ../E/derrick.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"a <a object|uranspot>yellow circle</a>  -> <a object|uranore>uranium "
"ore</a>."
msgstr ""
"un <a object|uranspot>cerchio giallo</a>  -> <a object|uranore>minerale di "
"uranio</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/derrick.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Any flat and geologically adequate surface of at least 2.5 meters wide."
msgstr ""
"Qualsiasi superficie pianeggiante geologicamente adatta, larga almeno 2,5 "
"metri."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/derrick.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Titanium or uranium ore in the subsoil."
msgstr "Minerale di titanio o uranio nel sottosuolo."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/derrick.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chunks of titanium or uranium ore."
msgstr "Pezzi di minerale di titanio o uranio."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/derrick.txt:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "10 seconds for titanium and 30 for uranium."
msgstr "10 secondi per il titanio, 30 per l’uranio."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/derrick.txt:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>Derrick</code>"
msgstr "<code>Derrick</code>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/egg.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alien Egg"
msgstr "Uovo alieno"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/egg.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The alien eggs are laid by the <a object|mother>Alien Queen</a>. After a "
"short time, they will hatch and an <a object|ant>ant</a>, a <a "
"object|wasp>wasp</a>, a <a object|spider>spider</a> or a <a "
"object|worm>worm</a> will come out."
msgstr ""
"Le uova sono deposte dalla <a object|mother>Regina aliena</a>. Dopo poco si "
"schiudono, liberando una <a object|ant>formica</a>, una <a "
"object|wasp>vespa</a>, un <a object|spider>ragno</a> o un <a "
"object|worm>verme</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/egg.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>AlienEgg</code>"
msgstr "<code>AlienEgg</code>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/energy.txt:1
#, no-wrap
