msgid "Target1"
msgstr "Bersaglio 1"

#. type: Image filename
#: ../E/target1.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "target1"
msgstr "target1"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/target1.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These buildings appear in the flying exercise missions and their height can "
"vary. In the center <a object|target2>Target2</a> is placed."
msgstr ""
"Queste strutture compaiono nelle esercitazioni di volo e possono avere "
"altezze diverse. Al centro si trova il <a object|target2>bersaglio 2</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/target1.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>Target1</code>"
msgstr "<code>Target1</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/target2.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the flying exercise missions, brown crosses indicate positions that have "
"to be crossed by a winged bot. They disappear as soon as a bot flies through"
" them. They are placed in the center of the <a object|target1>Target1</a> "
"building."
msgstr ""
"Nelle esercitazioni di volo, le croci marroni indicano posizioni che un "
"robot volante deve attraversare. Scompaiono al suo passaggio. Si trovano al "
"centro della struttura <a object|target1>bersaglio 1</a>."

