#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/bromush.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Brown Mushroom"
msgstr "Fungo marrone"

#. type: Image filename
#: ../E/bromush.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "bromush"
msgstr "bromush"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/bromush.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The growth of these harmless brown mushrooms signifies the presence of <a "
"object|uranore>uranium ore</a> in the subsoil. Use a <a "
"object|botsr>sniffer</a> in order to confirm that."
msgstr ""
"La crescita di questi innocui funghi marroni indica <a "
"object|uranore>minerale di uranio</a> nel sottosuolo. Usa un <a "
"object|botsr>robot rilevatore</a> per verificarlo."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/bromush.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>BrownMushroom</code>"
msgstr "<code>BrownMushroom</code>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/bush.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bush"
msgstr "Cespuglio"

#. type: Image filename
#: ../E/bush.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "bush"
msgstr "bush"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/bush.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A bush is a type of greenery that can be flattened by <a "
"object|botrecy>heavy tracked bots</a>, allowing other bots and <a "
"object|human>you</a> to pass through it as well."
msgstr ""
"Un cespuglio è una pianta che può essere schiacciata dai <a "
"object|botrecy>robot cingolati pesanti</a>, permettendo anche agli altri "
"robot e a <a object|human>te</a> di passare."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/bush.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>Bush</code>"
msgstr "<code>Bush</code>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/crystal.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Crystal"
msgstr "Cristallo"

#. type: Image filename
#: ../E/crystal.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "crystal"
msgstr "crystal"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/crystal.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The growth of these large blue crystals signifies the presence of <a "
"object|titanore>titanium ore</a> in the subsoil. Use a <a "
"object|botsr>sniffer</a> in order to confirm that."
msgstr ""
"La crescita di questi grandi cristalli blu indica <a "
"object|titanore>minerale di titanio</a> nel sottosuolo. Usa un <a "
"object|botsr>robot rilevatore</a> per verificarlo."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/crystal.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>Crystal</code>"
msgstr "<code>Crystal</code>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/gravi.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Gravi-plant"
msgstr "Pianta gravitazionale"

#. type: Image filename
#: ../E/gravi.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "gravi"
msgstr "gravi"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/gravi.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Gravi-plants generate a 25-meter radius green energy field that pushes <a "
"object|human>you</a> and your bots downwards, making flight impossible."
msgstr ""
"Le piante gravitazionali generano un campo energetico verde di 25 metri di "
"raggio che spinge verso il basso <a object|human>te</a> e i robot, impedendo"
" il volo."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/gravi.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>GraviPlant</code>"
msgstr "<code>GraviPlant</code>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/gremush.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Green Mushroom"
msgstr "Fungo verde"

#. type: Image filename
#: ../E/gremush.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "gremush"
msgstr "gremush"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/gremush.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These poisonous green mushrooms spew tiny corrosive balls upon being "
"approached. It is recommended not to get any closer than 12 meters unless "
"protected by a <a object|botshld>shielder</a>."
msgstr ""
"Questi funghi velenosi sputano piccole sfere corrosive quando ci si "
"avvicina. Conviene restare ad almeno 12 metri, a meno di essere protetti da "
"un <a object|botshld>robot scudo</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/gremush.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>GreenMushroom</code>"
msgstr "<code>GreenMushroom</code>"
